 "brief": "Gaza's police directorate rejected allegations made by the Israeli military following the assassination of Gaza's provincial police chief, Shehab Wire reported. The statement from the General Police Directorate characterized the Israeli claims as false and misleading, issued in response to an Israeli military announcement that followed the killing.\n\nThe police directorate did not immediately detail which specific allegations it was contesting or provide a point-by-point rebuttal to the Israeli military's claims. The exchange marked the latest dispute over narratives surrounding the death of a senior security official in the strip.",
